The HuggingFace API token `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` is **hardcoded as a fallback** in at least 5 source files across the client bundle. This token is shipped to every browser, giving any visitor unrestricted access to the AI API at FWC's expense.

