**File:** [auth.ts](file:///c:/Users/veere/Downloads/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/flowtracker/src/lib/auth.ts#L5-L9)

```typescript
const adminSupabase = createClient(supabaseUrl, supabaseAnonKey, {
