### CRIT-06: Dual Source of Truth for Applications

**Files:** [JobApplication.tsx](file:///c:/Users/veere/Downloads/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/flowtracker/src/pages/public/JobApplication.tsx#L248-L326), [ApplicationHub.tsx](file:///c:/Users/veere/Downloads/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/flowtracker/src/pages/hr/ApplicationHub.tsx#L76-L111)

