## SECTION 8: Recommended ATS Workflow

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> JobRequisition: HR creates requisition
    JobRequisition --> PendingApproval: Submit for approval
    PendingApproval --> Approved: Manager approves
    PendingApproval --> Rejected: Manager rejects
    Approved --> Published: HR publishes posting
    Published --> ApplicationReceived: Candidate applies

    ApplicationReceived --> AIScreening: Auto ATS scan
    AIScreening --> Shortlisted: Score >= threshold
    AIScreening --> Rejected: Score < threshold
    
    Shortlisted --> AssessmentAssigned: HR assigns assessment
    AssessmentAssigned --> AssessmentCompleted: Candidate completes
    AssessmentCompleted --> InterviewScheduled: HR schedules interview
    AssessmentCompleted --> Rejected: Assessment failed
    
    InterviewScheduled --> InterviewCompleted: Round completed
    InterviewCompleted --> NextRound: More rounds needed
    NextRound --> InterviewScheduled
    InterviewCompleted --> OfferPending: All rounds passed
    InterviewCompleted --> Rejected: Interview failed
    
    OfferPending --> OfferApproved: Finance approves
    OfferApproved --> OfferSent: HR sends offer
    OfferSent --> OfferAccepted: Candidate accepts
    OfferSent --> OfferDeclined: Candidate declines
    
    OfferAccepted --> Onboarding: Initiate onboarding
    Onboarding --> Hired: Onboarding complete
    Hired --> [*]
```

### Key Workflow Gaps in Current System

| Step | Current State | Required |
|------|-------------|----------|
| Job Requisition Approval | ❌ None — HR creates postings directly | Multi-level approval chain |
| Duplicate Application Prevention | ⚠️ Partial — checks `candidate_applications` but race conditions possible | DB unique constraint |
| Assessment Expiry | ⚠️ Token has `expires_at` but never checked | Server-side expiry enforcement |
| Interview Feedback Loop | ⚠️ Score recorded but no structured feedback form | Standardized scorecard per round |
| Offer Approval Chain | ❌ None — HR generates and sends directly | Finance → VP → HR approval flow |
| Offer Acceptance Tracking | ❌ Not tracked | Digital acceptance with e-signature |
| Background Verification | ⚠️ Fake AI verification | Third-party BGV integration |
| Onboarding Checklist | ❌ Single button click | Phased checklist with IT/Finance/HR tasks |

